#### Dashboard Configuration Format

Dashboards exported/imported as JSON with this structure:

```json
{
  "name": "Medicaid Claims Processing - Dashboard",
  "description": "Real-time Kafka metrics for claims processing topics",
  "refreshInterval": 60,
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Claims Topic Throughput",
      "query": "SELECT __timestamp, count(*) FROM medicaid_claims_topic GROUP BY TUMBLING(1 MINUTE)",
      "visualization": {
        "chartType": "line",
        "yAxisLabel": "Messages/Min"
      }
    }
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "readers": ["medicaid-developers", "medicaid-ops"],
    "editors": ["medicaid-lead-engineers"]
  }
}
```
